<title>USA: Mass. $50 mln housing deal yields 6.30 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Mass. $50 mln housing deal yields 6.30 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
